4. RAW EPİAŞ DATA -- TERMS OF THE ORIGINAL SOURCE
================================================================================

The files under inputs/market/realized_ptf_2026.csv,
inputs/market/historical_vep/*, inputs/historical/ptf_raw/*.csv, and
inputs/historical/rd_standardized.csv (and its _lag1 companion) are
DERIVED FROM data published by EPİAŞ (Enerji Piyasaları İşletme A.Ş.) on
its Şeffaflık Platformu (https://seffaflik.epias.com.tr/).  The relevant
Turkish market data is made publicly available under an EPDK Board
Decision.  These files are included in this repository for
reproducibility of the accompanying manuscript; their use, redistribution
and attribution are subject to the current EPİAŞ Şeffaflık Platformu
Terms of Use, which take precedence over the CC BY 4.0 licence stated
above.

EPİAŞ is not responsible for the accuracy, completeness or interpretation
of the data as re-published here.  Users who wish to redistribute or
reuse these EPİAŞ-sourced files, or any derivative thereof, should
consult the Terms of Use at https://seffaflik.epias.com.tr/ directly.
The authors of this repository make no warranty about the redistribution
status of the raw data and cannot grant permissions that only EPİAŞ can
grant.

Data preparation scripts (scripts/data/download_epias.py) and the derived
statistics that appear in the manuscript are, however, covered by the MIT
and CC BY 4.0 licences above, respectively.
